# Database Migrations

This directory contains the database migrations for the Wine Quality Prediction project.

Alembic is used to manage changes to the PostgreSQL database schema.

## Structure

```text
migrations
├── README
├── env.py
├── script.py.mako
└── versions
    ├── 1b3d5693a1e7_create_wine_data_table.py
    └── 92270fda58d9_create_predictions_table.py

